+msgid "For experts. How native Dolby Vision is sent to the TV. As certified players: the picture that the composer of ETSI GS CCM 001 builds, as it is, in the colour representation that the video describes (YCbCr, or IPT for profile 5), with metadata that describes it, as certified players send it; where the menus or subtitles are drawn over the video, those pixels are converted back into that representation. Converted to BT.2020: the picture is rebuilt in RGB and converted to BT.2020 YCbCr, as earlier builds sent it, to compare the two on a display. A video that is scaled to the screen (a 1080p one), or rebuilt by libplacebo's reshaping, goes out converted either way. What the fidelity step-down finds is not kept while Converted to BT.2020 is chosen. Applies from the next video."
+msgstr "Para expertos. Cómo se envía Dolby Vision nativo al televisor. Como los reproductores certificados: la imagen que forma el compositor de ETSI GS CCM 001, tal cual, en la representación de color que describe el vídeo (YCbCr, o IPT en el perfil 5), con metadatos que la describen, como la envían los reproductores certificados; donde los menús o los subtítulos se dibujan sobre el vídeo, esos píxeles se vuelven a convertir a esa representación. Conversión a BT.2020: la imagen se reconstruye en RGB y se convierte a YCbCr BT.2020, como la enviaban las versiones anteriores, para comparar las dos en una pantalla. Un vídeo que se escala a la pantalla (uno de 1080p), o que se reconstruye con el reshaping de libplacebo, sale convertido en ambos casos. Mientras está elegida la conversión a BT.2020, lo que encuentra la reducción de fidelidad no se recuerda. Se aplica desde el siguiente vídeo."
+
+#: system/settings/settings.xml
+#. Hades, value of setting "videoscreen.hadesdvtransport": the composer's picture as it is, as certified players send it (the default); also on the Dolby Vision page of the player information; the core string #39896
+msgctxt "#32002"
+msgid "As certified players"
+msgstr "Como los reproductores certificados"
+
+#: system/settings/settings.xml
+#. Hades, value of setting "videoscreen.hadesdvtransport": the picture rebuilt in RGB and converted to BT.2020 YCbCr; also on the Dolby Vision page of the player information; the core string #39897
+msgctxt "#32003"
+msgid "Converted to BT.2020"
+msgstr "Conversión a BT.2020"
+
+#: addons/skin.estuary/xml/Variables.xml
+#. Hades, on the Dolby Vision page of the player information, after #32003, where the other transport is asked for and the video is not one it covers (a scaled one)
+msgctxt "#32004"
+msgid "not possible with this video"
+msgstr "no es posible con este vídeo"
